This License applies only to material that Starfall Org or another copyright
holder has validly placed under this License.

Third-party components remain subject to their own license terms. If any
portion of the repository was previously distributed under another license by a
copyright holder and Starfall Org lacks authority to relicense that portion,
this License does not revoke rights already granted under that earlier license
or override that copyright holder's terms.

